prevent them from doing things like "summon nasties" three turns in a
row.  Most of Magicbane's afflictions and luck have nothing to do with this; 
he's simply limited in how often he can cast a spell, and trying to do 
so beforehand creates a state that is represented to the player as a 
failure -- via the messages you were seeing.

